\ The generated eliminator word `Shape?`: one quotation arm per variant, each
\ annotated with the variant it handles, matched by name rather than position.
\ An owning scrutinee hands each arm the whole narrowed variant, which the arm
\ reads through `&field` projections and then consumes.

type: Shape
| Circle r i64
| Rect   w i64 h i64
;

: area ( Shape -- i64 )
  ~[ ( Rect )   &w @ swap &h @ swap drop mul ]
  ~[ ( Circle ) &r @ swap drop dup mul 3 mul ]
  Shape? ;

: main ( -- )
  5 Circle area .     \ 75
  3 4 Rect area . ;   \ 12
